  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1325\" height=\"117\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Fantasy's Furniture</strong> 是一款模組化模组，為《我的世界》添加了各種全新的<strong>傢俱套組</strong>與<strong>裝飾性</strong>方塊。<br>這些傢俱方塊包含但不限於<strong>床鋪</strong>、<strong>座椅</strong>、<strong>書架</strong>、<strong>門</strong>、<strong>烤爐</strong>、<strong>沙發</strong>、<strong>架子</strong>、<strong>櫃檯</strong>和<strong>門</strong>。</p>\n<h3><strong>合成配方</strong></h3>\n<p>每件傢俱均可透過我們的新<strong>傢俱工作台</strong>方塊進行合成，只需放入對應的<strong>羊毛</strong>與<strong>木板</strong>方塊，並搭配<strong>結合劑</strong>道具（<strong>黏土球</strong>）即可。</p>\n<p><strong>傢俱工作台</strong>可在任何 2x2（或更大）的合成格中，透過放入<strong>工作台</strong>加上<strong>皮革</strong>來合成。</p>\n<h3><strong>擴充模組</strong></h3>\n<p>《Fantasy's Furniture》已拆分為多個模組，每個傢俱套組各佔一個。這樣設計是為了讓玩家能夠自由選擇想要遊玩的傢俱套組。<br>若單獨安裝《Fantasy's Furniture》主模組將無法獲得任何內容，因此請務必安裝下方其中一個模組。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture-nordic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>北歐風</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture-venthyr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>溫西爾</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture-dunmer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>卓爾</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture-bone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>骨頭</strong> - 包含兩種變體（<strong>骨頭</strong>與<strong>凋靈</strong>）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture-royal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>皇室</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture-necrolord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>死靈盟主</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>除了上述模組外，我們還推出了<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture-decorations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>裝飾品</strong>模組</a>。與前述模組不同，此模組並未新增任何傢俱套組，而是提供了多種額外的裝飾性方塊。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我們的 <strong>Discord</strong> 社群</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/third_party/discord_banner.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"59\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fapexstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f4d8198a-6c2a-4d86-8d74-1977589e8ef7.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
